# ZFS Snapshots Checker ignore-list example
#
# One case-sensitive substring per non-comment line.
# A snapshot is ignored when its snapshot name contains any listed substring.
# Matching is against the part after @, not the dataset name.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
#
# This ignores names such as:
# SnapBeforeWatchTower-Date-2026-09-02_08_10_59
SnapBeforeWatchTower
